ns-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- 2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 현재 서울시민</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">의 자녀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">으로 비서울 소재 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년제 대학교 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">3, 4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학년 재학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, 2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">학기 현재 마지막 정규학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">(8</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">학기초과자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">휴학생 및 타대학에서 편입하여 현재 대학에서의 정규학기 성적이 없는 학생은 신청 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">기초생활수급자 또는 차상위계층으로 증빙서류 발급이 가능한 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">전체학기 평점 평균의 백분위 성적 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">90</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">점 이상인자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">소속학과 교수의 추천을 받은 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">선발 후 장학생 프로그램에 적극적으로 참여할 수 있는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: ~ 4. 1.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 17:00</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">장학금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">연간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">400</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(200</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">*2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">온라인 신청 후 서류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">등기우편</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">교수 추천서 이메일 발송 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 2022. 4. 6.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">온라인 신청 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">재단 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(www.hissf.or.kr) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">장학금 안내 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">대학생 장학금 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">서울 우수인재 장학금 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">장학금 신청 클릭 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">온라인 신청</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">서류제출처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: (04130) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림,